    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d260">

                <pb facs="0323" n="239" xml:id="pg239"/>

                <head>[Telegram.—Translation.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-04"><hi rendition="#italic">November 4,
                        1903</hi>.</date><lb/>(Received 10.30 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To His Excellency the <hi rendition="#small-caps">President of
                        the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>The municipality of Panama is now (10 p.m.) holding a solemn session, and joins
                    in the movement of separation of the Isthmus of Panama from the rest of
                    Colombia. It hopes for recognition of our cause by your Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Demetro S. Brida.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
